{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":43998406,"ns":0,"title":"Dialectical logic","extract":"Dialectical logic is the system of laws of thought, developed within the Hegelian and Marxist traditions, which seeks to supplement or replace the laws of formal logic. The precise nature of the relation between dialectical and formal logic was hotly debated within the Soviet Union and China.","description":"System of laws of thought","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}